WEBVTT

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.230
I'm a human.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:11.990
Human?

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:14.110
Kind of thing.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:26.350
I guide restless spirits with 
earthly regrets to the Rinne no Wa.

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:27.130
I'm a shinigami.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.130
Shinigami?

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:31.030
Kind of thing.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:32.570
Kind of thing?

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:36.010
What does that even mean?

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:10.550
<i>Here at this school is a haunted place, 
a so-called legendary weather box,</i>

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:14.740
<i>that's beginning to gather attention.</i>

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:21.710
Maybe it's a god that's 
protecting this school.

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:23.120
Or an evil spirit.

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:32.190
Apparently you write your problem and put 
it in here, and it solves it for you.

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:34.880
Don't forget your money and offerings.

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:40.340
The envelope disappeared!

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:43.070
I'm so scared!

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:43.670
Wait, Rika-chan!

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.060
No offerings.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:47.170
Oh well.

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:49.270
I can find food with the money they left.

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:52.440
<i>The Haori of the Underworld 
worn by Rinne Rokudou</i>

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:56.780
<i>turns the wearer into a spirit entity and 
renders them invisible to normal people.</i>

00:02:57.590 --> 00:02:59.190
What does it say?

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:02.160
<i>Mamiya Sakura can see spirit entities.</i>

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:06.780
"I wish for Nakabayashi-kun from Class 3
and Yokko from Class 2 to hook up."

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:08.350
Relationship problems.

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:09.820
And not even her own.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.170
This is outside of my jurisdiction.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.580
Aren't you going to accept it?

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:14.670
I can't be useful.

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:16.550
I'm a shinigami.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:18.980
Kind of thing.

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:24.740
Only five yen.

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:27.140
For good luck with relationships, isn't it?

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:29.820
I'll starve to death.

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:31.850
Shinigamis starve to death, too?

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:33.600
I'm a human.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:36.040
Kind of thing.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:38.730
<i>So which is it?</i>

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:45.120
Freak of the Club Building

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:43.350
What exactly is going on, Rokudou-kun?

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:50.370
Fifty years ago, my grandma, 
a shinigami, came to reap a certain man.

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:54.000
A sickly young man with 
a minute left to live.

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.640
My, he's hot!

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:00.260
He was totally her type.

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.370
Are you a shinigami?

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:03.930
You're beautiful.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.890
Beautiful? Oh, you.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:10.600
I'm glad I could meet a beautiful 
woman like you in the end.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:16.650
Although I may die now and be reborn 
as a bug or lizard or something.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.250
You're a mackerel in your next life.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:20.780
A mackerel?

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:22.650
Yes, a sekisaba mackerel.

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:26.320
Those are delicious simmered in miso.

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:31.930
His lonely smile gripped her 
heart, and Grandma fell in love.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.980
That to-be-mackerel man was my grandpa.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:38.970
Your grandpa is a human?

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:42.210
So you're a shinigami and human...

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:45.380
Grandma pulled a lot of strings

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:49.870
and broke a few laws to extend 
Grandpa's lifespan by fifty years.

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:51.720
The two lived together happily.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:56.120
But this spring, Grandpa 
got on the Rinne no Wa.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.310
I see.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:00.250
So your grandpa died.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:04.110
He's probably drifting around on 
the Kuroshio currents about now.

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.700
I thought sekisaba mackerel 
lived in the Seto Inland Sea.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.830
Anyway, that's more or less how I came to be.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:13.390
Yeah?

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:15.370
What about your mom and dad?

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:17.710
I don't know.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:20.540
I've always lived with my grandpa.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.620
<i>Maybe I shouldn't have pried so much.</i>

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:38.820
But does that mean Rokudou-kun 
is living by himself now?

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:41.190
Is that why he's so poor now?

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:45.530
It doesn't look like he's making 
much money with his shinigami work.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:52.560
Besides, why does he have to do shinigami 
work when he has human blood?

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.490
It's Miho-chan.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.340
Hello?

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:00.840
<i>Sakura-chan, hear me out.</i>

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.770
<i>I was so scared.</i>

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:03.710
Scared?

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:07.570
I went back to school to get 
something I left behind.

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:12.170
When I passed by that club building 
that's scheduled for demolition,

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:15.790
through the window of one 
of the empty rooms...

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.730
It was totally a hinotama!

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:21.900
<i>A hinotama?</i>

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.570
<i>I think the god that was worshiped there</i>

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:27.150
<i>when it was built is angry 
because it's getting torn down.</i>

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:30.200
I got scared and I ran home, 
but it's been bothering me.

00:06:30.510 --> 00:06:32.560
<i>Please, come with me tomorrow.</i>

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.330
<i>I want to make sure.</i>

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:36.620
Sure, but...

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:42.400
Hey, Miho-chan, are you sure 
you weren't just seeing things?

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:43.770
I definitely saw it.

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:46.640
Then how about you make a 
request to the weather box?

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.340
I don't know.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.150
Here, it's this.

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:55.100
It does look old and haunted, but...

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:57.710
<i>This is the club building?</i>

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:02.220
<i>Something's coming.</i>

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:05.860
Mrowwwr

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.320
<i>So there <i>is</i> something here.</i>

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.820
Monster!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.830
Those two can see it, too?

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:20.580
Rokudou-kun.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.920
Mrowrrr!

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:29.630
It's gone.

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:35.600
<i>What's up with that cat monster?</i>

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:41.380
<i>Miho-chan and Rika-chan could see 
it too, so maybe it wasn't a spirit.</i>

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:45.620
It's a kitten.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:48.630
It's so cute.

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:50.940
It's hurt.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.500
I'll help you get better.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:55.740
Come to my place.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:00.080
Here.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.650
Milk and dried bonito rice.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:02.510
Eat up.

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:10.150
People will think you're a stray 
if you don't wear a collar.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:11.760
I might have a ribbon.

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:14.650
Behave yourself, okay?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.420
I'm back.

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:37.910
Look out! You'll fall!

00:08:43.430 --> 00:08:44.610
Where am I?

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:50.170
Wait.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:52.980
Wait up.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:01.250
Have you gotten a bit bigger?

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:11.110
It's...

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.360
The club building?

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:16.740
A hinotama.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.420
So it <i>was</i> you.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:19.850
I never told you to do that.

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:21.990
Ow! But...

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:26.960
I did all of it for you, Rinne-sama.

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:28.150
See.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.170
Dried bonito rice.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.290
I found it.

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.430
You...

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:33.710
Where did you get such a fancy meal?

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:39.490
Mamiya Sakura.

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:41.140
Why are you here?

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:43.560
That's my question.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:45.520
Would you care to explain?

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:56.610
So this was the hinotama.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.780
I can't pay for electricity.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:02.300
So what do you do here?

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:03.290
Nothing.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.370
I just live here.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:06.730
You're allowed to do that?

00:10:06.730 --> 00:10:08.480
Does it even matter?

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:09.540
I can live here for free.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.890
Poor Rinne-sama.

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:15.380
He got kicked out of his 
rental when his grandpa died.

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:17.450
I left.

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:19.270
Because paying for rent is a waste.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:21.830
Be quiet.

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.030
What?

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:26.500
Don't make any noise.

00:10:33.830 --> 00:10:34.970
It's gone.

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:36.210
What is it?

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:38.060
It's probably security.

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:40.160
I don't want to get caught and kicked out.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:40.990
Right.

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:46.710
Rokumon, you can go home now.

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:47.290
Huh?

00:10:47.670 --> 00:10:51.030
Don't worry, I'll be fine on my own.

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:55.670
I've been prepared since the day 
I decided to live on this side.

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:58.260
You're called Rokumon-chan, huh?

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.590
Yes, Miss Sakura.

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:01.610
Listen to me.

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.530
I'm not going.

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:05.620
Tamako-sama gave me an order.

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:06.640
Grandma did?

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:10.940
Rokudou-kun's grandma's 
name is Tamako-san, huh?

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:14.480
Employment Contract
 Employer
 Employee
 <i>Rokumon</i>

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:14.480
So here's the employment contract.

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:17.820
Sign and stamp here where it says "Employer."

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.860
A thumbmark is fine.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:20.890
Wait.

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:23.780
Aren't you already a black cat 
contractor for my Grandma?

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:26.310
That was only until tomorrow.

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:28.790
Hey, what's a black cat contractor?

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:34.860
We black cats have been in coexistence 
with the shinigamis since long ago.

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.880
From the day we sign our contracts,

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:40.140
we do curses, we make 
threats, make prophecies,

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:46.120
and fight evil spirits, among other 
general support work for the shinigamis.

00:11:47.620 --> 00:11:50.500
So, Rokumon-chan...

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:51.520
Over here.

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:53.250
This slick looking one.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.360
Let's assume this is you just 
for the sake of argument.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.900
Tamako-sama said to me...

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:06.390
Please, Rokumon, use your excellence 
and intelligence to help Rinne.

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:08.430
Understood, Tamako-sama.

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:10.200
Umm...

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:13.390
Here! This slick one is me.

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:17.290
Let's assume this is you. 
Let's <i>pretend</i> it's you.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:20.560
I still don't need you.

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:21.170
Go home.

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:25.940
Sign in the next thirty 
minutes, and delivery is free!

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:26.750
Free?!

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:28.100
<i>There is no delivery fee.</i>

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:32.630
Shoot, you almost had me at "free."

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:34.730
I'm not signing the contract.

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:37.610
Sign now, and I'll even throw in detergent.

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:40.610
You sound like a newspaper salesperson.

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.080
I use the soap in the 
bathroom. I don't need it.

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:46.340
Then how about this?

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:49.150
This one-of-a-kind shinigami 
item, evil spirit food!

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:50.330
I'll throw this in!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.660
How do you use that?

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:58.290
You feed it to an evil spirit, and 
it becomes violent and goes berserk.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:02.550
After it does an appropriate amount of 
damage, Rinne-sama can come in to help.

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:05.550
And the weather box will 
be filled with offerings!

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:06.520
No!

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:10.060
I stole it from Tamako-sama's place for you!

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:12.100
Just give up.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.140
I'm not signing.

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:14.510
Come on.

00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:17.010
You just have to stamp your thumb here.

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:17.520
No thanks.

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:24.030
Don't try to forge it!

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:27.410
Why won't you take my contract, Rinne-sama?

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:29.820
I don't have the luxury of hiring you.

00:13:29.820 --> 00:13:30.660
That's final.

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:32.080
Ow.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.580
I put this hair into this straw doll, and...

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:39.540
Curse upon you!

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:40.880
Shut up!

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.880
Mrowwwr

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:45.880
Mrowwwr!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:51.220
Sign the contract!

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:52.970
Leave!

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:57.850
I feel kind of sorry for him.

00:13:58.240 --> 00:14:01.100
Mamiya Sakura, you go home, too.

00:14:01.100 --> 00:14:03.850
I came here through what 
I think was the Reidou.

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:06.170
I don't have my wallet, and I'm barefoot.

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:08.690
I remember watching an anime on TV

00:14:08.690 --> 00:14:12.370
about a clumsy housewife that was like 
that, back when Grandpa was still alive.

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:18.290
Hey, do you really not care to hire that cat?

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.270
I don't.

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:22.370
He said he came under 
Grandma's orders, right?

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:27.840
Grandma is probably trying to keep 
me tied to the shinigami world.

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:29.300
I see.

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:32.100
You're her only grandchild, after all.

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:35.360
Sorry for all the trouble.

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:36.450
Thanks.

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:37.910
See you tomorrow.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:38.640
Bye.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:48.240
Isn't Rokudou-kun lonely living in that 
abandoned club building by himself?

00:14:48.510 --> 00:14:50.910
Of course he's lonely.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:52.950
You came back?

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.490
Yes, Miss Sakura.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:15:00.060
Rinne-sama is really a tragic person.

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:02.290
His grandpa died, huh?

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:03.460
Yes.

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:08.660
And his grandmother, Tamako-sama, 
lost her right to live on this side.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:10.840
What do you mean?

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:14.930
There was apparently a promise 
for Tamako-sama, the shinigami,

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:19.900
to live in the human world for as long 
as Grandfather, the human, was alive.

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:21.060
Oh really?

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:27.470
And Tamako-sama had another important 
promise with the shinigami world.

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:35.490
Do you, in extending this 
human's life by fifty years,

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:40.500
promise to satisfy ten times the 
quota of a shinigami's work?

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.620
I do.

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:48.040
Should you fail to meet the quota, your 
grandchildren will also do your work.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:48.920
Do you accept?

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:49.880
I do.

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:54.130
<i>She didn't meet her quota.</i>

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.390
What?!

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:02.310
So Rokudou-kun's paying her grandma's debt?

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:04.400
Well, something like that.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:09.490
But Rinne-sama has human blood. 
He isn't a full shinigami.

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:15.150
He can do the work, but he has to rely 
on more tools than a normal shinigami.

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:18.220
The expenses for the tools add up.

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:21.040
So that's why he's always looking for money.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:27.070
That's why I want to use my black cat 
powers to help Rinne-sama with his work.

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:28.360
I see.

00:16:28.360 --> 00:16:33.380
Oh, Miss Sakura, could you 
help me out with something?

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:34.760
Help you out?

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:38.010
Please gather some people at 
the club building tomorrow.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:38.810
People?

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:40.020
Yes.

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:41.520
For Rinne-sama's sake.

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:45.890
Damn it, he made a mess.

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:48.900
An envelope.

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:51.400
Rokumon must have left it behind.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:55.410
"To Rokumon-sama, from Tamako"

00:16:59.190 --> 00:17:00.290
Evil spirits?

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:01.830
I swear, I saw it.

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.790
You saw it too, right, Sakura-chan?

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.590
Yeah, I did.

00:17:09.490 --> 00:17:11.340
Here come the sacrifices.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:13.670
My plan is perfect!

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:20.680
Mrowwwr

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:20.680
I'm going to scare these students 
to the depths of terror!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:24.180
That'll bring a ton of business 
to Rinne-sama's weather box.

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:27.560
Signing bonus

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:28.520
And I'll get a higher signing bonus.

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:31.870
Rinne-sama.

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:33.040
Sorry, I read this.

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:35.810
<i>Rokumon-chan,</i>

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:37.330
<i>Notice of Dismissal</i>

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:39.040
<i>Sorry, you're fired.</i>

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.810
<i>Rinne has an opening,
 how about you try him?</i>

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:44.150
<i>From Tamako. <3</i>

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:46.410
Sorry, Rokumon.

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:49.920
You came here because you 
needed my help, didn't you?

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:54.170
Sorry I can't be of any help.

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:58.300
Please, don't apologize.

00:18:02.050 --> 00:18:02.760
Huh?

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:05.900
Suzuki-sensei.

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:06.480
Hm?

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:09.280
What's going on?

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:11.290
We're tearing down the old club building.

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:13.020
No one's using it anymore.

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:15.240
But...

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:21.780
I'll leave.

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:23.330
I'm sorry.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.460
Rokumon.

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:30.710
For the trouble I've caused, 
and as a small gift...

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:33.710
Mrowwwr

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:33.710
I'll go attack the students!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:35.050
Stop.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:39.180
What was that for, Rinne-sama?

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:41.790
<i>That's</i> the trouble you've caused.

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:48.690
Are those mice?

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:08.750
It turned huge!

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:18.630
Rokudou-kun.

00:19:20.710 --> 00:19:24.010
It looks like it's the spirit of a 
mouse that lived in the club building.

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:26.610
You didn't notice them living there?

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:28.880
No, I did notice their presence.

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.360
That's excellent, Rinne-sama!

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:32.980
You were making them squirm 
until they showed their tails.

00:19:33.490 --> 00:19:36.140
I thought it was security, so I was hiding.

00:19:36.140 --> 00:19:37.650
I didn't realize it was a spirit.

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:41.730
It's huge, though.

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:45.020
To think that an ordinary animal 
spirit could become so violent.

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:52.750
Hey, couldn't this be it?

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.330
The evil spirit food.

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:57.670
It must have ate it after Rokudou-kun 
threw it out yesterday.

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:05.890
It must be angry that its home 
is about to be destroyed.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:09.450
No one gave you permission to 
live there. Don't be so pissy!

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:10.890
<i>That goes both ways.</i>

00:20:12.050 --> 00:20:14.370
Mamiya Sakura, lend me 500 yen.

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:16.060
Huh?

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:17.860
I'm going to buy a shinigami tool.

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:21.450
Sure, but I forgot my wallet.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:22.360
Again?!

00:20:27.930 --> 00:20:28.930
What do we do?

00:20:28.930 --> 00:20:29.910
Run.

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:33.320
I can't fight that thing without any tools.

00:20:33.320 --> 00:20:35.440
Can't you take out a loan or anything?

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:38.130
I don't pass the evaluations with my income.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:03.600
You didn't need any tools.

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:05.620
I saved 500 yen!

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:09.540
<i>It was decided that the whole 
thing was a haunting caused</i>

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:14.410
<i>by the god worshiped at the club building, 
and the demolition was canceled.</i>

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:17.040
I'll be going now.

00:21:17.510 --> 00:21:19.330
Be well, you two.

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:20.550
Rokumon-chan.

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:25.090
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:26.100
About what?

00:21:26.100 --> 00:21:28.090
I mean, about Rokudou-kun.

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:30.660
Rokumon.

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:34.160
What are you doing?

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:34.930
We're going home.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:38.260
Rinne-sama.

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:39.310
Then are you—

00:21:39.930 --> 00:21:41.360
Be prepared.

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:42.900
My work is tough.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:44.660
Rinne-sama.

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:46.200
Okay.

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:48.610
Good for you, Rokumon-chan.

00:21:49.820 --> 00:21:50.700
Yes.

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:53.810
This is all thanks to you, Miss Sakura.

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:55.940
Thanks, Rokudou-kun.

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:56.950
For what?

00:21:56.950 --> 00:22:00.710
For what? You're signing Rokumon-chan's 
contract, aren't you?

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:03.920
Yeah. He'll be useful when
I don't have money from now on.

00:22:08.830 --> 00:22:15.270
<i>And so Rokudou Rinne signed Rokumon's 
employment contract, albeit only for a meager wage.</i>

00:22:17.610 --> 00:22:21.590
This place is like heaven, though.

00:22:21.590 --> 00:22:25.050
I get food just by transforming 
into a kitten and sitting in a box.

00:22:25.050 --> 00:22:27.660
You're paying for your 
own food expenses, then.

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:30.280
<i>A </i>very<i> meager wage.</i>

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:25.270
Next Episode
 If You Don't Mind
Starting as Friends

00:24:00.920 --> 00:24:02.250
Mamiya-san, it's me.

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:02.830
Huh?

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:03.710
Long time.

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:04.860
It's me.

00:24:04.860 --> 00:24:06.000
Umm...

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:07.250
It's me!

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:08.140
Umm...

00:24:08.140 --> 00:24:09.710
The flamenco dancer?

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:12.060
All right! Wait, I mean, it's me!

00:24:12.060 --> 00:24:13.670
"Me"? "Me"?

00:24:13.670 --> 00:24:15.960
Y'know, from elementary school.

00:24:15.960 --> 00:24:17.140
Oh, oh yeah!

00:24:17.140 --> 00:24:17.960
Do you remember now?

00:24:17.960 --> 00:24:20.760
What was the difference between 
café au lait and café latte again?

00:24:20.760 --> 00:24:21.140
Huh?

00:24:21.570 --> 00:24:25.270
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: 
"If You Don't Mind Starting as Friends."
